# Origin for the auction-demo.bunsenbrenner.org demo. Caddy terminates TLS, so it
# needs NO inbound :80/:443 of its own (the origin is only reachable through the
# tunnel). The agent (Browser Plane) forwards the raw TLS to this Caddy; TLS
# terminates here, at the origin, keeping the edge/plane payload-blind.
#
# Unlike flappy-demo/cookbook-demo (static index.html + Caddy file_server, with only
# the build endpoint proxied), the auction-demo-bridge IS the whole web server here
# -- it serves the dashboard AND the live /events stream itself -- so Caddy's only
# job is TLS termination + reverse-proxying everything to it. Streaming responses
# (SSE) pass through reverse_proxy unmodified; no special config needed.
#
# The cert is issued CORE-side (CADS-Tunnel's scripts/authorize-pipeline.sh, deSEC
# DNS-01 with the operator's zone-wide token) and mounted in as static files -- this
# Caddyfile only ever reads fullchain.pem/privkey.pem, never holds a DNS credential.

auction-demo.bunsenbrenner.org {
	reverse_proxy auction-demo-bridge:8789
	encode gzip
	tls /certs/fullchain.pem /certs/privkey.pem
	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
		X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
	}
}
